      "writtenOn": "2021-07-28T10:13:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "we already have kh_version here. why did we have to move some cr50-specific code to u2f_sign() which is now in board/cr50, but leave other cr50-specific code (like handling kh_version) here, in the common code.\n\nwe should \n\n1) either make kh_version a common feature and handle here. then we don\u0027t need to push u2f_sign() into board/cr50, just the underlying utility functions like dcrypto/random should be in board/cr50\n\n2) or move this entire function to board/cr50 and let other boards implement their own versions of u2f.\n\ncan we do #1? if not, what\u0027s the problem?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 235,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 235,
        "endChar": 20
      },
      "revId": "58e38ce847a9181b5edac56feb9ecb2deedb437a",
